<title>Nigeria: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/nigeria/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-nigeria-2026-11-10T10:08:44.372Z</guid>
<pubDate>Tue, 10 Nov 2026 10:08:44 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Gunmen continue to raid villages in Zamfara, killing a security volunteer and 11 of his relatives and abducting 13 people, while another band of attackers burned 12 members of a Muslim family alive and seized seven others in the same state. In Plateau, gunmen attacked two communities, killing five civilians, injuring two, and later killed a soldier and three locals in a separate assault. Police moved into a bandits' enclave in Sokoto and the army killed a suspected criminal and recovered an AK-47 in an Oyo forest where abducted schoolchildren had been held. An APC chieftain was killed by his son with a sledgehammer in Edo, and a son of a former Kaduna governor condemned an attack on NDC supporters in Delta. The conflict recorded 1,486 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiogFBVV95cUxNT2xBbzE2Y3hocDhNRFdzbGVUbUtGNVh5Q002WFNUaGJmaXlEaE1UdVZuU0d3R2RGbkVLaDNTTU41QTM0cWV2THFON2pDTWNtWnIwOE5RSXA1cy0taHBxTU1adkE1cVBmNEFyTkdWZmZsM1MyenFsbEgtMGgyeFNxeDVxa3VORTBBTVdOSExiMEZtOXlOZEJwcXN3R0JEbHhlenc?oc=5&quot;&gt;Big News Network.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijgFBVV95cUxNNVJaY2JyX29abVVyR1c4QlRVeHNDa0tqT2t4bXBXUWZOMmJFWUNaY2lYaXZYaFVMaXJaT1ZvbWd4Rm9UWmJwSGVieXFDX29RVUF5UDNTZy1oN0dkM2Z0VU8wY0FxdWt2SzJuM3B1Q1JLZ2tFOTR3blpscUVaSFdmai1wOGtVYXota0xoSUVB?oc=5&quot;&gt;New Telegraph&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqwFBVV95cUxPb19KX1ZldzBsdS10d0Ywa2FJTmhtQUxZVzFxbTh6VnhhdXd4dXAwOGRvR1MwYTVVZTRoM1A2UGdYNHZ0R2FaQUU4T29BY2NRX0NtVUo3azBZUktlanNPZTBsY0M0YS1lUC1YbDg1cnYxNDFZcWFldEczWUd0bEg2U1VsVWZzWkJvRmxlQmdBWnVPMHlURUhGb3IyeTg2bUo4ZUR5RU53eGpyUVk?oc=5&quot;&gt;Peoples Gazette Nigeria&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihgFBVV95cUxNQkNKYURKV1ZyS2VETHV